{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"benicio-del-toro","name":"Benicio del Toro","birthDate":"1967-02-19","birthPlace":"San Germán, Puerto Rico","bio":"Benicio Monserrate Rafael del Toro Sánchez (Latin American Spanish: [beˈnisjo ðel ˈtoɾo]; born February 19, 1967) is a Puerto Rican actor. His accolades include an Academy Award, a BAFTA Award, a Golden Globe, a Goya Award, a Cannes Film Festival Award for Best Actor, and a Silver Bear. Films in which he has appeared have grossed over $5.9 billion worldwide.\n\nDel Toro made his film debut in Big Top Pee-wee (1988) before his breakout role playing an unintelligible crook in the crime thriller The Usual Suspects (1995), followed by roles in Basquiat (1996), Fear and Loathing in Las Vegas (1998), and Snatch (2000). He received the Academy Award for Best Supporting Actor for his role as a morally upright police officer in the Steven Soderbergh crime drama Traffic (2000). He was nominated in the same category for his role as an ex-con in Alejandro González Iñárritu's thriller 21 Grams (2003). He has since acted in Sin City (2005), Che (2008), Savages (2012), Inherent Vice (2014), Sicario (2015), No Sudden Move (2021), and One Battle After Another (2025). \n\nHe also took on franchise roles such as Lawrence Talbot in The Wolfman (2010), the Collector in three films from 2013 to 2018 in the Marvel Cinematic Universe, and DJ, the codebreaker, in Star Wars: The Last Jedi (2017). He also acted in the Wes Anderson films The French Dispatch (2021) and The Phoenician Scheme (2025). On television, he portrayed Richard Matt in the Showtime miniseries Escape at Dannemora (2018), for which he received a nomination for the Primetime Emmy Award for Outstanding Lead Actor in a Limited Series or Movie.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Benicio del Toro, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-16T12:13:20+00:00","tmdbId":1121,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/1121","credits":[{"id":"guardians-1","title":"Guardians of the Galaxy","character":"The Collector"},{"id":"infinity-war","title":"Avengers: Infinity War","character":"The Collector"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/benicio-del-toro.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Learning, Studying… Always Perfecting: The Making of One Battle After Another","year":2026,"character":"Self","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/b1y72qIIUIpkprJijwVFV0n4Ik2.jpg"},{"name":"Teofilo: Boxing's Most Revolutionary Champion","year":2025,"character":"Narrator","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aMLhmEp99VJJlFeREwsqVcv0AKe.jpg"},{"name":"One Battle After Another","year":2025,"character":"Sensei Sergio St. Carlos","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lbBWwxBht4JFP5PsuJ5onpMqugW.jpg"},{"name":"The Phoenician Scheme","year":2025,"character":"Zsa-zsa Korda","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iXxIUVqpQAlyy98UjUlzjkMYuj6.jpg"},{"name":"Neurótica Anónima","year":2025,"character":"","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eU7tw9NIaWbCL51uzMjP35QRkre.jpg"},{"name":"Reptile","year":2023,"character":"Tom Nichols","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/soIgqZBoTiTgMqUW0JtxsPWAilQ.jpg"},{"name":"Bonnie","year":2022,"character":"Self","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nVwgdHqaiQjRJE7nuE3kUhBHXZL.jpg"},{"name":"The French Dispatch of the Liberty, Kansas Evening Sun","year":2021,"character":"Moses Rosenthaler","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6JXR3KJH5roiBCjWFt09xfgxHZc.jpg"},{"name":"No Sudden Move","year":2021,"character":"Ronald Russo","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kARdPEc4b32GQlHmJXMhGOCplEA.jpg"},{"name":"What If...?","year":2021,"character":"The Collector (voice)","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lztz5XBMG1x6Y5ubz7CxfPFsAcW.jpg"},{"name":"Dora and the Lost City of Gold","year":2019,"character":"Swiper (voice)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xvYCZ740XvngXK0FNeSNVTJJJ5v.jpg"},{"name":"Other Music","year":2019,"character":"Self","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dFQnkjAQSJ4TJkxm5YC20QvdggX.jpg"},{"name":"Raúl Juliá: The World’s a Stage","year":2019,"character":"Self","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2izT9SnXMyEu7AMLaq80eCrQ6OE.jpg"},{"name":"Nice Girls Don't Stay for Breakfast","year":2019,"character":"Self - Actor","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5Kvse1IZv0Z56TqRrkaFpy7UKih.jpg"},{"name":"The Kelly Clarkson Show","year":2019,"character":"Self","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sBix25bie9UQFzbarN51DpFO5ky.jpg"},{"name":"Sicario: Day of the Soldado","year":2018,"character":"Alejandro Gillick","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/OdD7A0LgLXPjqzmfcEl9sTYVPo.jpg"},{"name":"Avengers: Infinity War","year":2018,"character":"The Collector","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7WsyChQLEftFiDOVTGkv3hFpyyt.jpg"},{"name":"The Director and the Jedi","year":2018,"character":"Self","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kc19s3pN3gxEcOSM6H20rFlRODo.jpg"},{"name":"Escape at Dannemora","year":2018,"character":"Richard Matt","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/odk6ccUtUJlGTzPApKS6s4CTTrK.jpg"},{"name":"Star Wars: The Last Jedi","year":2017,"character":"DJ","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kOVEVeg59E0wsnXmF9nrh6OmWII.jpg"},{"name":"Battle Zone: The Origins of Sicario","year":2016,"character":"(archive footage)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aCKhJEdmV2QW3u6bJ3HV9uQAf1l.jpg"},{"name":"The Poet of Havana","year":2015,"character":"Self","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tGW4VYTfXuqAGCaqZqWvK2BzGne.jpg"},{"na